sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as ROS 2 Client
    participant N as adi_iio node
    participant H as libiio ctx / IIO HW
    C->>N: EventAttrReadString(iio_path)
    N->>N: parse iio_path (device / channel event attribute)
    N->>H: read event attribute
    H-->>N: value / errno
    N-->>C: success=true + value (in message)
    Note over N,C: on failure, success=false and message carries the errno string
